WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.690
For years, SRITNE at ISB has been at the forefront of India's

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.240
digital journey, from studying

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.480
platforms and data governance to advanced scaling and

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.760
innovation.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.120
As I take on the role of an executive director, we are

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:15.880
building on that foundation with two

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.560
new pillars.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.740
The first one, technology for impact and development, where

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:22.720
we explore how digital innovation can

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.670
make growth more inclusive, from digital public goods to AI

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.540
for entrepreneurship and livelihoods.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:32.430
The second pillar is going to be technology for growth and

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.880
startups, where we want to

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:37.250
partner with India's most dynamic firms and founders to

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.440
understand how technology drives

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:43.440
scale, competitiveness and go-to-market success.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.200
Together, these pillars reflect SRITNE's belief that

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.600
technology must serve both growth

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:50.600
and good.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.380
So, if you are from the industry, government or academia

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.120
and share our excitement for these

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:58.720
themes, join us in shaping ideas and impact through these

00:00:58.720 --> 00:00:59.720
initiatives.

